{start_of_outro}
That lucky [Am]ciga-rette, layin' [F]on our backs
We were [C]out of breath, we both [G]took a drag
Blew it [Am]in the sky, she was [F]gone like that
One hell [C]of a night, one hell [G]of a pack
Instrumental fade — end on last chord of progression.
{end_of_outro}
